t corners. With each attempt, you\u2019ll learn new shortcuts, refine your route, and discover that speed is the key to surpassing yourself. Will you be able to find the perfect path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014760/extras/d7fcc8bbf07a4e0bf429cf63dd099dc2.avif?t=1758326744\" width=587 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014760/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.poster.avif?t=1758326744\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014760/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.webm?t=1758326744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014760/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.mp4?t=1758326744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The challenge is not just reaching the goal: as you progress, heat and obstacles will put your endurance to the test. One wrong step, a poorly timed jump\u2026 and you\u2019ll end up as a puddle. Every mistake means starting over, but also an opportunity to improve your strategy. Tension rises, pressure builds, and only the fastest will survive the ticking clock. Become the most agile ice cube and prove your cool under pressure!</p>","developers":["OneGuyProductions"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat